        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-amanda-mw6jqagc-aglbgakm8vv",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Your driver will meet you at Buenos Aires International Airport for a private transfer to your hotel.\n\n\n\n\nYou’ll get your first look at the Argentine capital on the way. Buenos Aires is often compared to Paris for its architecture and broad streets. The city moves to its own South American rhythm, with historic mansions, modern neighbourhoods, leafy parks, cafés and tango all side by side.\n\n\n\n\nOnce you’ve checked in, you can rest after your flight and spend the rest of the day at your leisure."
